  "bodyHash": "mb4fiEoViRs=",
  "content": "<p>這是一款粒子類模組，新增2種光效軌跡。載入後，您可以在EpicFight的<code>item_skins</code>文件中將<code>particle_type</code>&nbsp;更改為&nbsp;<code>light_trail_mod:light_trail</code>或&nbsp;<code>light_trail_mod:bloom_trail</code>，即可看到更明亮的軌跡效果。</p><p>首頁：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvillager-dusk.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://villager-dusk.github.io/</a></p><p>(<span style=\"color:#3598db\">bloom_trail的光效比light_trail更明亮，目前bloom_trail僅支援minecraft-1.19.2forge版本。</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">未來除非有數百人要求更新，否則將僅維持支援1.19.2與1.18.2版本。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">我厭惡Minecraft&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">1.20.1</span></span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">！！！</span>)</p><p>針對1.19.2版本，我們準備了模組檔案：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fthe-download-link-for-light-trail-mod.netlify.app%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載中......</a></p><p><strong>範例：<code>iron_greatsword.json：</code></strong></p><div>\n<div>\n<div>{</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"trail\": {</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"color\": [216, 216, 216],</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"begin_pos\": [0.0, 0.0, -0.2],</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"end_pos\": [0.0, -0.24, -1.8],</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"lifetime\": 6,</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"interpolations\": 40,</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"texture_path\": \"epicfight:textures/particle/swing_trail.png\",</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong>\"particle_type\": <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">\"light_trail_mod:light_trail\"</span></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; //或：<span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong>\"particle_type\": <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">\"light_trail_mod:bloom_trail\"</span></strong></span></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</div>\n<div>}</div>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong><code>注意：僅載入此模組不會產生任何效果。</code></strong></p><p><strong><code>light_trail效果截圖：</code></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283295/description_343d8710-0d75-420d-ba56-94916fb4a3a3.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283295/description_655014ff-3a80-4020-ae93-82ed78488692.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"806\" height=\"454\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283295/description_847dbd5b-71e6-46d0-b911-d979eb0c8324.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"806\" height=\"454\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><code>bloom_trail效果截圖：</code></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283295/description_814502eb-4973-4837-9fb0-d25535a65d82.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"431\" height=\"288\"></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283295/description_8e07821c-2b33-4f3c-a1cb-7a49a50b8ddc.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283295/description_626c42d4-2a4b-4765-98b8-6840af9fc3cd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"353\" height=\"239\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283295/description_166b086c-9310-4f72-a40c-13799fb48e6c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"338\" height=\"233\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283295/description_ff5f41e0-5dcf-4949-a51b-a4978f567892.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"253\"></p>\n\n（註：已保留原始HTML結構與所有超連結、圖片路徑及程式碼區塊，僅對說明文字進行繁體中文本地化轉換，並採用台灣常用術語如「模組」、「載入」、「軌跡」等用詞）",
